{
    "title": "PowerZ: New WorldZ",
    "description": "What if there was a REAL video game for learning while having fun?\r\n \r\nTransform into an apprentice magician, explore a magical universe, and learn by playing captivating educational mini-games! Creativity, logic, and exciting trivia await you in Aria!\r\n \r\nPOWERZ: NEW WORLDZ is the free educational kids game for ages 6 to 12. Join us and discover an unforgettable adventure!\r\n \r\nOUR MISSION: TO MAKE LEARNING FUN AND ACCESSIBLE TO ALL!\r\n \r\nFollowing our highly successful launch of our first kids game, PowerZ, we're returning even stronger with PowerZ: New WorldZ.\r\n \r\n \r\nTHE ADVANTAGES OF POWERZ: NEW WORLDZ:\r\n \r\n- Immerse yourself fully in the magical world of Aria with a true video game experience.\r\n- Enjoy a smooth, uninterrupted gaming experience with no advertising.\r\n- Exciting educational mini-games adapted to each kids\u2019 skill level thanks to artificial intelligence, covering math, grammar, geography, history, and more!\r\n- Secure multiplayer mode to share your adventure with friends and family.\r\n- Endorsements from celebrities like Edouard Mendy and Hugo Lloris, and developed with guidance from education experts like Bayard and Hachette Books.\r\n \r\n \r\nA FANTASTIC NEW UNIVERSE!\r\n \r\nJoin the Aria Academy of Magic! Explore an enchantingly mysterious realm and solve the riddles that stand in your way.\r\nLearn magic from the most powerful (and funniest) mages and wizards.\r\nBattle Amnevolence with your loyal chimera companion by your side! Don\u2019t let evil destroy all of Aria\u2019s knowledge!\r\n \r\n \r\nAN EDUCATIONAL KIDS GAME FOR ALL LEVELS!\r\n \r\nMathematics, geography, history, music, cooking... Our AI adapts to each kids\u2019 skill and potential. There's no need to specify your age or school level; the mini-games adjust in difficulty based on your answers.\r\n \r\n \r\nBUILD A UNIQUE LIVING SPACE TO IMPRESS YOUR FRIENDS:\r\n \r\nTake a break from your adventures and spruce up your haven! Gather resources and personalize your own living space. Invite your friends to explore it and share the magic together in our secure multiplayer mode!\r\n \r\n \r\nGROW AND RAISE YOUR ADVENTURE COMPANION!\r\n \r\nCare for your chimera egg. Play music and introduce it to new friends to help it hatch. Fire, water, nature, and more... The choice is yours! Each action shapes your chimera's element, creating a loyal and endearing adventure sidekick.\r\n \r\n \r\nHELP US IMPROVE THE GAME!\r\n \r\nShare your comments, feedback, insights, etc., about the game via our social networks.\r\nHelp us make PowerZ the best educational kids game, making learning accessible and enjoyable for all!\r\n \r\n \r\nAN ADVENTURE BASED KIDS GAME FOR EDUCATION\r\n \r\nTo provide a unique educational experience for new and returning players alike, we've mobilized all our efforts with the help of educational experts and your valuable feedback to exceed all expectations!\r\n \r\nWe aim to bring you a captivating story alongside engaging educational mini-games that will inspire you to learn and improve your skills in math, geography, English, and more!",
    "descriptionHTML": "What if there was a REAL video game for learning while having fun?<br> <br>Transform into an apprentice magician, explore a magical universe, and learn by playing captivating educational mini-games! Creativity, logic, and exciting trivia await you in Aria!<br> <br>POWERZ: NEW WORLDZ is the free educational kids game for ages 6 to 12. Join us and discover an unforgettable adventure!<br> <br>OUR MISSION: TO MAKE LEARNING FUN AND ACCESSIBLE TO ALL!<br> <br>Following our highly successful launch of our first kids game, PowerZ, we&#39;re returning even stronger with PowerZ: New WorldZ.<br> <br> <br>THE ADVANTAGES OF POWERZ: NEW WORLDZ:<br> <br>- Immerse yourself fully in the magical world of Aria with a true video game experience.<br>- Enjoy a smooth, uninterrupted gaming experience with no advertising.<br>- Exciting educational mini-games adapted to each kids\u2019 skill level thanks to artificial intelligence, covering math, grammar, geography, history, and more!<br>- Secure multiplayer mode to share your adventure with friends and family.<br>- Endorsements from celebrities like Edouard Mendy and Hugo Lloris, and developed with guidance from education experts like Bayard and Hachette Books.<br> <br> <br>A FANTASTIC NEW UNIVERSE!<br> <br>Join the Aria Academy of Magic! Explore an enchantingly mysterious realm and solve the riddles that stand in your way.<br>Learn magic from the most powerful (and funniest) mages and wizards.<br>Battle Amnevolence with your loyal chimera companion by your side! Don\u2019t let evil destroy all of Aria\u2019s knowledge!<br> <br> <br>AN EDUCATIONAL KIDS GAME FOR ALL LEVELS!<br> <br>Mathematics, geography, history, music, cooking... Our AI adapts to each kids\u2019 skill and potential. There&#39;s no need to specify your age or school level; the mini-games adjust in difficulty based on your answers.<br> <br> <br>BUILD A UNIQUE LIVING SPACE TO IMPRESS YOUR FRIENDS:<br> <br>Take a break from your adventures and spruce up your haven! Gather resources and personalize your own living space. Invite your friends to explore it and share the magic together in our secure multiplayer mode!<br> <br> <br>GROW AND RAISE YOUR ADVENTURE COMPANION!<br> <br>Care for your chimera egg. Play music and introduce it to new friends to help it hatch. Fire, water, nature, and more... The choice is yours! Each action shapes your chimera&#39;s element, creating a loyal and endearing adventure sidekick.<br> <br> <br>HELP US IMPROVE THE GAME!<br> <br>Share your comments, feedback, insights, etc., about the game via our social networks.<br>Help us make PowerZ the best educational kids game, making learning accessible and enjoyable for all!<br> <br> <br>AN ADVENTURE BASED KIDS GAME FOR EDUCATION<br> <br>To provide a unique educational experience for new and returning players alike, we&#39;ve mobilized all our efforts with the help of educational experts and your valuable feedback to exceed all expectations!<br> <br>We aim to bring you a captivating story alongside engaging educational mini-games that will inspire you to learn and improve your skills in math, geography, English, and more!",
